    "product_and_use": "A non-load-bearing indoor desk cable organizer tray, with the same fictional 200 by 80 mm nominal footprint for each setup.",
    "materials_and_variation": "Each whole recipe contains only recovered HDPE matrix and cork filler; the HDPE is the matrix/binder, with no additional binder. Quantities, cork percentages and prices all use the same as-received mass basis. The incoming characterized portion contains an unknown 28–32 mass percent cork. The separately characterized added stock contains 5 mass percent cork, with the remainder HDPE.",
    "process_and_equipment": "The same fictional compression-molding process P and nominal footprint are stated for both recorded setups, with process settings unspecified. Home planning only: no physical handling, processing, measuring equipment or lab access is available during this exercise.",
